{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "c00192d9c2d363c29abdd08250ad7e75fe112360fe9c082eb43b5261f65ef893", "ja": "朋花ちゃん、恋したことないの！？　てっきり……\nあれ？　でも、そっか。私たちって……。", "zh": "朋花，你从来没谈过恋爱！？我还以为……\n咦？不过，原来如此。我们这些人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "cf8ca924c71c405fd9347f2a4ce2173ff2e726104a3028f9e6689f40d6d97706", "ja": "私も、激しい恋のひとつやふたつ、\n経験されているのかと思いましたが……そうでした。", "zh": "我还以为您经历过一两段轰轰烈烈的恋爱……不过，说起来确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "9d023b2453586e28f7dfb5297444aaf85f1dc6e9b76be3c19a3349677c324a7e", "ja": "たまたま、そういう曲が多いだけですよ～？\n私は、アイドルですからね～。", "zh": "只是碰巧这种歌曲比较多而已啦～？\n因为我是偶像嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "5e1ba949ae2ccc4dfa230c7fb5d1ed125f298d692b56d159741123c20fa39226", "ja": "そ、そうだよね！\n私たち、アイドルだもん！　恋とか、難しいよね……？", "zh": "对、对哦！  \n我们可是偶像嘛！谈恋爱什么的，很难吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "2e497b5b750a88032eef56e0208acc2dae6421ae717c584c42f7dc4ae5ee509f", "ja": "はい。アイドルの恋は、スキャンダルの原因に\nなります。ですが……。", "zh": "是的。偶像谈恋爱，会成为丑闻的导火索。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "a884fa97b29e5b316232348c7984bbce9edb4c86aa401a16079c163e780b89c5", "ja": "うふふ。瑞希さんは、恋する気持ちを歌うには、\n経験も必要……と、考えているんですね～？", "zh": "呵呵。瑞希小姐是觉得，要唱出恋爱的心情，也需要经验……对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "30d47b57207a9b49fcabd752c41054d703080a0b367c5354ce25d37e91fd8c79", "ja": "なんと。心を読まれてしまいました。", "zh": "哎呀，心思被看穿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "85323e1f51e29c9324a0be91dfff381fe8166fa6f0fd8543a6ddcf3621296bd4", "ja": "お疲れさま。遅れてごめんなさい。\n取材が長引いてしまって……。", "zh": "辛苦了。抱歉来晚了。\n采访拖得有点久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1009_p", "source_sha256": "81a3d3f4027714928c564842298ab50d6f82022ac73407c9c1abd11dc4a4d854", "ja": "お疲れさま……ん？　みんな、なんだか\n難しい顔をしてるけど……何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了……嗯？大家的表情好像都很严肃……是发生什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "77eddd6cb3eba7b925d4d63593ccce5359ea60346478e4f3e21db242ddcd7aeb", "ja": "いいえ～。私の新曲が、恋の歌のようだったので……\n恋の経験の有無について、話していたんです～。", "zh": "不是啦～因为我的新歌好像是首恋爱歌曲……所以我们在聊有没有恋爱经历～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "238640dc79a9fc291ef7f1d840e043e09b14f471e07917e066a2b8c12c9115d4", "ja": "なになに？　恋の経験！？\nそんなの、もちろん必要フケツだよ！", "zh": "什么什么？恋爱经验！？  \n那种东西，当然是必要不洁啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1012_p", "source_sha256": "abde386c4da34287ac4134c8e0fb3262e55a855525d17428798f31948e09c5a1", "ja": "それを言うなら、必要不可欠な……\nで、朋花は必要だと思ったのか？", "zh": "要说那个，应该是“必不可少”……\n那么，朋花觉得这是必要的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "055d04e16d8256e62243b28d1723b23076f6ddaa09f420d0f087ecc49877e9fe", "ja": "そう言われましても……\n聖母は、恋をしませんから～。", "zh": "你这么说的话……\n圣母可不会谈恋爱哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "fa673a465302b7fc5ded8e615032092c9c06ada0f4910a6bd80b31566151f6e6", "ja": "な、なんだってーっ！？", "zh": "什、什么——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "281067ba8c325c221833206ed9c8b331d89083fa30a07c3494af0641e495fc88", "ja": "ええっ、そんなぁ！？　\n言いきっちゃっていいの？　朋花ちゃん！", "zh": "诶诶，这怎么行啊！？\n就这么断言真的好吗，朋花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "810bb367de7cc172bcb2d9cd86adf48dcdff4dabc5ce5809ba2377e2cf4874f1", "ja": "そうだよ、朋花様！\nイッショーに一度の人生なんだよ！？", "zh": "就是啊，朋花大人！\n人生只有一次嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "7f2d20475f30025a608e2eb1625aee6155e3091dd8e3346e7aebee983d95a940", "ja": "そう言われても、特に……？\n私はアイドルですし、聖母ですから～。", "zh": "就算你这么说，也没什么特别的吧……？\n我可是偶像，也是圣母哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "bb776bbc03b854927adbb4376c4406273f24a83787a5e7c2d75ed76bb902fc65", "ja": "……。\n{$P$}は、どう思われますか？", "zh": "……。\n{$P$}是怎么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7b735982c82dbceec181a281bfcd6b800f882db15087b5c888af04c597e6db59", "ja": "そうだな。立場上、手放しでみんなに\n「恋をした方がいい」とは言えないけど……。", "zh": "是啊。站在我的立场上，没法毫无顾虑地对大家说“还是谈恋爱比较好”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2b5d50d80c8c0651c7898b558ff62d1f1bd170565ee5826cd99b92d85041cf44", "ja": "恋愛感情を持つ事自体は、個人の自由だと思う。\nだから、制限をするつもりもないよ。", "zh": "我觉得，产生恋爱情感本身是个人的自由。\n所以，我也没打算加以限制。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "10a6bbacda6b7551ceb87ca577bb66034c316d4f8d6a82f25eb275c3a1d9afad", "ja": "それは、甘いんじゃないですか～？\n{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "是不是太天真了～？\n{$P$}先生～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1022_p", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "1c8287e20ec2fb44e3bdd339009dce0ef686519c329241ddf49c7a3809d4dcb3", "ja": "アイドルが、自分のためだけに恋をするなんて……。", "zh": "偶像竟然只为了自己而恋爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "920aaf6e57f530bcefadd6b2afead8c325e85f773f148986cf1afe407940808a", "ja": "それは、応援してくれるファンの子豚ちゃん達への、\n裏切りではありませんか～？", "zh": "这样不就是对那些支持自己的粉丝小猪们的背叛了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7628e2164e8403dc12acf46c308630bf816598de9f03366842999b504dd6cab1", "ja": "まぁ……確かに、ファンのみんなは、\nショックを受けるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "嗯……确实，粉丝们可能会受到打击，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca5298623bd65184fc722efb73e2c9bed948eb4192e54c42b09e0df62a5f03b7", "ja": "千早さんは、どう思われますか～？", "zh": "千早小姐，您觉得怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "7d28839cafd1c3f5fe3fc4ab2b982ecfcba4fbb213870e07d45649721f167b5a", "ja": "私？　そうね……。", "zh": "我？这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "db0743420470486692174125a479bff450b0dc8ba42f889d9de2a3394ab0bbca", "ja": "恋の歌を歌うのに、必ずしも経験が必要とまでは\n思わないけど……経験が、歌に活きる場合もあるかと。", "zh": "我不觉得唱恋爱歌曲就一定需要相关经验……不过，有时候经验也能融入歌声之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "d65848167d2c551a45b5188a21d4f76f87542a2b59389d37654b79597896627d", "ja": "だから、アイドルに恋は必要ない……とまでは、\n言いきれないと思う……。", "zh": "所以，我觉得也不能断言偶像不需要恋爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "1c8e692dc6ee5ee6cb7c10848a193cf2fcdb00da0d495be18b53d14a2bdc4399", "ja": "なるほど～。千早さんが言うなら、\nそうなのかもしれませんね～……。ふむ……。", "zh": "原来如此～。既然是千早小姐这么说，或许确实是这样呢～……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "6b682d37c8cfa99578fd3aceacb0737d535df784dec90d5ded7ba2b04d3ac51d", "ja": "そういえば……以前、美也さんから\nこんな話を聞きましたよ～？", "zh": "说起来……之前美也小姐曾跟我说过\n这样的事情哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "46b0be18995983ccce64c93576d559e558051373d08e20ab8c5b3218c238dba9", "ja": "初恋を知るために、{$P$}さんに\n初恋をしようとしたとか……。", "zh": "听说为了了解初恋，曾经想和{$P$}先生谈一场初恋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7fa43c7f4a700177540af3af4522edba406b9c1d8ceff07755677ea82f69f64f", "ja": "ああ……そういえば、\nそんな事もあったな……。", "zh": "啊……这么说来，确实还有过那种事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "b251a56956a6f2bbd911f1fc1637aae0dcaf3cc336eb801023d42299b8ec2f32", "ja": "そうですか～。\nなら、私がお願いしても構いませんね～？", "zh": "这样啊～  \n那我拜托您也没关系吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e20140d2076068f95dcbb07aa8d6c9a0e3b3c9214185cff8c3b0f9e582e7715c", "ja": "えっ！？　それは……。", "zh": "诶！？那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "17a6ac376a1fc0375e50d50cb995679b7e56801c8678946831c300cb3cd12007", "ja": "あら……。\nまさか、断るわけじゃありませんよね～？", "zh": "哎呀……\n您总不会是要拒绝吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1037_p", "source_sha256": "fa4934c6802d08ff49cbb522da9a85445c413256f78a2cc839877a5482885ffe", "ja": "い、いや、そういうわけじゃ……。", "zh": "没、没有，我不是那个意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9063600d6beae8af3ce1790d0e509ac24a58ce6bb41f1fe0a8c3463e46ff01a4", "ja": "わ、わかったよ！\n協力するから！", "zh": "我、我知道了啦！\n我配合就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "ea6ce629dbd1ccf315767f8490b039babf0e830e732616dae32a4d335ab9a051", "ja": "うふふっ。それでこそ、\n{$P$}さんですよ～。", "zh": "嘻嘻，这才像\n{$P$}先生嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "0c4a03c9391cba4f8aa870ae308a5274a18ca3cb560a0eb1bdd1469a0d52eeea", "ja": "それでは、聖母が恋を知るためのレッスン、\nお願いしますね～？", "zh": "那么，为了让圣母懂得恋爱的课程，就拜托您了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d2a72bb203aebe9cee319b7961d0e3f0e307ba31ccc2223173e04cfc23b27d4", "ja": "れ、レッスンって……\n朋花ちゃんと、{$P$}さんが！？", "zh": "练、练习是说……\n朋花和{$P$}先生吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_140_1042_011ami", "source_sha256": "d721dfbfb3b231e9603b19f1be2249bc11dee1822473d0dbfd7153964117d5c1", "ja": "ふたりが恋しちゃうってこと！？", "zh": "意思是两个人会坠入爱河！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
